{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05676","headline":"送新罗法师还国 · 孙逖","name":"送新罗法师还国","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"异域今无外，高僧代所稀。\n苦心归寂灭，宴坐得精微。\n持鉢何年至，传灯是日归。\n上卿挥别藻，中禁下禅衣。\n海阔杯还度，云遥锡更飞。\n此行迷处所，何以慰虔祈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙逖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05676.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05676","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}